cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "astana-access: a data-driven framework for spatial accessibility assessment and optimal siting of social infrastructure"
abstract: >-
  Open pipeline that reconstructs population below the district level, measures walking
  accessibility to state schools and preschools in Astana, diagnoses its inequity, tests the
  siting of new schools against capacitated optima and publishes the results as a web atlas.
